{"i":48,"start_s":244.31,"end_s":251.89,"speaker":"SPEAKER_05","speaker_conf":"low","overlap":false,"low_conf":false,"text":"of justice, that's 7,000 people in my little state. Nearly 1,000 of them reported to work on Tuesday to receive a"}
{"i":49,"start_s":251.89,"end_s":257.25,"speaker":"SPEAKER_01","speaker_conf":"high","overlap":false,"low_conf":false,"text":"furlough notice. They have families, they have mortgages,"}
{"i":50,"start_s":257.59,"end_s":257.99,"speaker":"SPEAKER_06","speaker_conf":"high","overlap":false,"low_conf":false,"text":"they have"}
{"i":51,"start_s":257.99,"end_s":271.7,"speaker":"SPEAKER_05","speaker_conf":"low","overlap":false,"low_conf":false,"text":"payments, they have medical expenses. And suddenly we said, oh, I'm sorry, we people here, the Republicans in the House representatives of a small segment of them,"}
{"i":52,"start_s":271.88,"end_s":273.71,"speaker":"SPEAKER_05","speaker_conf":"high","overlap":false,"low_conf":false,"text":"are saying we're making points"}
