{"i":77,"start_s":352.88,"end_s":361.25,"speaker":"SPEAKER_04","speaker_conf":"high","overlap":false,"low_conf":false,"text":"then pass in conference appropriations bills in regular order. On the Treasury, the federal judiciary, District of Columbia,"}
